    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A spoiled Boston debutante who charmed her way through life, Scarlet Carson O'Toole manipulated a rich but dim-witted vampire, Rudy Scruggs, into Embracing her before abandoning him. After Scruggs' destruction, his pack The Misery Lords adopted her, and she became a veteran information-gatherer and eventual pack leader, extracting Camarilla secrets by exploiting Kindred prejudice against Caucasian vampires while all eyes stay fixed on the Cathayans.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>O'Toole trades on a childlike, harmless appearance that consistently gets her underestimated. She and The Misery Lords have proven more useful to Sabbat Templar Consuela Martinez than Martinez's own pack, Killing Spree, hoping their usefulness earns them power once San Francisco falls.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Rudolph Scruggs (destroyed). Works closely with Consuela Martinez and Killing Spree. Disciplines (as printed): Celerity 4, Fortitude 1, Obfuscate 2, Presence 1, Protean 3.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
